<title>UK: Dated Brent trades at 25 cents under December paper.</title>
<headline>Dated Brent trades at 25 cents under December paper.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>A European oil company sold one million barrels of Brent loading Dec 1-3 at Dec paper -25 cents, up 20 cents from the previous day's deals, the buyer said.</p>
<p>Four Brent dates are scheduled for nomination on Friday and there were no early takers of the cargoes an hour before the five o'clock deadline, traders said.</p>
<p>-- Kate Dourian, London newsroom +44 171 542 4088</p>
